subQuestions.questionText:
The following TWO variables have been declared in Delphi:

    sString: String;
    cChar: Char;

Which ONE of the following statements will result in an error?

The following segment of code has been provided:

    Line 1   var
    Line 2      iNum, iAnsw : Integer;
    Line 3      rNum, rAnsw : Real;
    Line 4   begin
    Line 5      iNum  := 25;
    Line 6      rNum  := 15;
    Line 7      iAnsw := iNum/5;
    Line 8      rAnsw := 15 MOD 3;
    Line 9      iAnsw := rNum MOD 3;
    Line 10  end;

State whether Line 7 is CORRECT or INCORRECT and give a reason for your answer. (NO marks will be awarded if only CORRECT or INCORRECT is provided.)
